Third-party data notice
=======================

The packaged data object `wdi_lhwr` is derived from the World Bank World
Development Indicators (WDI):

https://datacatalog.worldbank.org/search/dataset/0037712/world-development-indicators

The WDI catalog identifies the dataset as licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: World Bank, World Development Indicators.

The included object covers 2010--2024 and contains selected WDI indicators,
country identifiers, transformed variables, and Lorentz-model coordinates.
The transformations are documented in `?wdi_lhwr`. The Lorentz coordinates
use log constant-price GDP per capita and trade openness with the frozen
location and scale constants recorded there. The package authors prepared the
derived object and are responsible for the transformation and any errors in
it; the World Bank does not endorse the package or its analysis.
